        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngomnyaka wetshumi lanye enyangeni kaBuli, okuyinyanga yesificaminwembili, kwaphela konke ukwakhiwa kwendlu njengokumiswa kwayo. Wathatha iminyaka eyisikhombisa ukuyakha.",
